{#
    „Průběh zápasu" — match event timeline, visible to everyone once events exist.

    Expects:
      - sport_match  (SportMatch)
      - match_events (list of MatchEvent, ordered minute desc / nulls last)

    Pure match events: minute · colour-coded dot · „Gól — Messi (ARG)". There are
    deliberately NO tip counts here — the product owner deferred „tipovalo N hráčů"
    to a future fantasy feature (item 10, decision 4). Do not substitute a number.

    Dot colors per event type: goal = win (green), yellow card = draw (gold),
    red card = loss (red). The sport-aware kickoff row („Výkop" / „Úvodní
    vhazování") closes the timeline at the bottom.
#}
{% if match_events|length > 0 %}
    {% set home_code = sport_match.homeTeam.shortName ?: sport_match.homeTeam.name %}
    {% set away_code = sport_match.awayTeam.shortName ?: sport_match.awayTeam.name %}
    <section class="card-glass p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="eyebrow">Průběh zápasu</h2>

        <ol id="match-timeline" class="mt-4">
            {% for e in match_events %}
                {% set dot_class = e.type.value == 'goal' ? 'bg-win' : (e.type.value == 'yellow_card' ? 'bg-draw' : 'bg-loss') %}
                <li class="timeline-row">
                    <span class="timeline-min">{% if e.minute is not null %}{{ e.minute }}'{% endif %}</span>
                    <span aria-hidden="true" class="timeline-dot {{ dot_class }}"></span>
                    <span class="timeline-text">
                        {{ e.type.label }} — {{ e.player.name }}
                        <span class="timeline-side">({{ e.side.value == 'home' ? home_code : away_code }})</span>
                    </span>
                </li>
            {% endfor %}

            {# The kickoff closes the list. No minute: it is a marker, not a recorded event. #}
            <li class="timeline-row">
                <span class="timeline-min"></span>
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="timeline-dot bg-white/25"></span>
                <span class="timeline-text text-white/60">
                    {{ sport_match.matchSource.sport.code == 'hockey' ? 'Úvodní vhazování' : 'Výkop' }}
                </span>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </section>
{% endif %}
